  "body": "## Changes\n\n## Features\n\n- feat(desktop): drag accounts between groups ([#113](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/113)) by @AlbinAxtelius, @claude, @Paliago\n\n## Fixes\n\n- fix(tui): complete shutdown after terminal hangup ([#119](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/119)) by @Paliago\n- fix(security): update rustix to 1.1.6 ([#118](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/118)) by @Paliago\n- fix(security): vendor pin-utils and upgrade rustls ([#117](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/117)) by @Paliago\n- fix(security): address CVE-2026-118764 in awsesh ([#112](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/112)) by @Paliago\n\n## Maintenance\n\n- chore(release): prepare v1.4.3 ([#120](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/pull/120)) by @Paliago\n\n## Contributors\n\n@AlbinAxtelius, @Paliago and @claude\n\n[Full changelog](https://github.com/elva-labs/awsesh/compare/v1.4.2...v1.4.3)\n\n\nSource commit: 868b6da24691aa7a768c192989dd057ebfac7eff\n",
